  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Blood Hunter Level 7</em></p>\n<p><strong>Effect:</strong> For 1 hour, at the start of each of your turns when you have at least 1 Hit Point but fewer than half your Hit Points remaining, you regain Hit Points equal to your Proficiency Bonus.</p>\n<p><strong>Side Effect:</strong> Your Speed is reduced by 10 feet for that hour.</p>\n<section class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Regeneration (regain HP equal to Proficiency Bonus at start of turn when below half HP) cannot be automated via Active Effects. Track this manually.</p></section>",
